  <Prefabs>
    <Prefab xsi:type="MyObjectBuilder_PrefabDefinition">
      <Id Type="MyObjectBuilder_PrefabDefinition" Subtype="Prefab_VI-HXL_Heavy_Salvage_Lifter" />
        <DisplayName>VI-HXL Heavy Salvage Lifter</DisplayName>
        <Description>Engineered specifically for structural recovery, heavy salvage acquisition, and logistics, the VI-HXL delivers absolute planetary dominance. This dedicated, pure all-atmospheric transport features a completely clear central undercarriage designed to hover directly over large detached wreckage components—such as full-sized refineries and jump drives—and transfer them securely across vast planetary distances.</Description>
        <Icon>Textures\GUI\Icons\VIX Prefabs\VI-HXL_Heavy_Salvage_Lifter.dds</Icon>
        <TooltipImage>Textures\GUI\Icons\VIX Prefabs\VI-HXL_Heavy_Salvage_Lifter_Tooltip.png</TooltipImage>
        <EnvironmentType>PlanetWithAtmosphere</EnvironmentType>
